        <mxCell id="r44" value="V2.44 Token Budget Optimizer&#xa;• cache hit / repeated reading reduction&#xa;• omitted_items&#xa;• role-based context pack&#xa;验收：小 budget 不保留无证据建议" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fae8ff;strokeColor=#c026d3;fontSize=14" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="390" width="320" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
